{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach, take, process and move to specific location while scanning with fallback in case of obstacles. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
